{
  "version": "Notebook/1.0",
  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "# 🧩 WUfB - Driver Compliance Report\n\nQuesto workbook traccia lo stato di installazione e gli alert dei **driver e firmware** distribuiti via Windows Update for Business.\n\n**Sorgenti**: `UCClientUpdateStatus`, `UCServiceUpdateStatus`, `UCUpdateAlert`, `UCClient` (filtro `UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"`).\n\n> **Filtro Tipo PC:** di default vengono mostrati solo i **PC Modern**, intesi come macchine **Windows 11** il cui hostname inizia per `MP5`, `WP5`, `KP5`, `TP5`, `MS5`, `WS5`, `KS5` o `TS5`. Imposta *Tipo PC = Tutti i PC* per includere anche gli altri dispositivi.\n\n> **Nota v3:** rimossi i filtri e le colonne `UpdateManufacturer`, `DeviceManufacturer` e `DeviceModel`. `DeviceManufacturer`/`DeviceModel` non sono garantiti disponibili in `UCClient` su tutti i workspace (il dato anagrafica device va recuperato da `IntuneDevices`), e non è stata trovata traccia di `UpdateManufacturer` popolato in modo affidabile.\n\n> **Nota v4:** allineata la definizione di **PC Modern** a quella della KB Compliance Report: richiede Windows 11 *e* hostname con prefisso MP5/WP5/KP5/TP5/MS5/WS5/KS5/TS5 (in precedenza bastava non essere Windows 10).\n\n> **Nota v5:** aggiunto il filtro per nome driver. La vista **Stato Installazione per Device + Driver** applica i filtri ClientState, Nome Driver e Nome PC e mostra anche l'ultimo alert correlato, incluso lo stato dell'eventuale errore.\n\n> **Nota v6:** la vista **Stato Client e Alert per Device** include i filtri Alert Status, Alert Classification e Alert Subtype.\n\n> **Nota v7:** i tre filtri Alert sono stati spostati dalla barra generale in un blocco locale interno alla vista **Stato Client e Alert per Device**.\n\n> **Nota v8:** ogni vista dispone ora di filtri locali coerenti con le proprie colonne. Restano globali soltanto Intervallo Temporale e Tipo PC."
      },
      "name": "text-header"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "d2a2e001-1111-4a1a-b1c1-111111111111",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "TimeRange",
            "type": 4,
            "isRequired": true,
            "typeSettings": {
              "selectableValues": [
                {
                  "durationMs": 604800000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 1209600000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 2592000000
                },
                {
                  "durationMs": 7776000000
                }
              ],
              "allowCustom": true
            },
            "value": {
              "durationMs": 2592000000
            },
            "label": "Intervallo Temporale"
          },
          {
            "id": "d2b2f002-9999-4b2b-c2d2-999999999999",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "ModernOnly",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "query": "datatable(value:string, label:string, selected:bool)\n[\n  'modern', 'Solo PC Modern (Windows 11, hostname MP5/WP5/KP5/TP5/MS5/WS5/KS5/TS5)', true,\n  'all', 'Tutti i PC', false\n]",
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": []
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "label": "Tipo PC"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters-global"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 📊 Compliance per singolo driver\n\nFiltri locali per nome driver, UpdateClassification e OS Version. Ogni riga rappresenta uno specifico driver e classificazione; la percentuale mantiene come denominatore tutti i device che hanno riportato uno stato per quel driver."
      },
      "name": "text-section-summary"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "e8a10001-0001-4001-8001-000000000001",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SummaryDriverNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Nome Driver (contains)"
          },
          {
            "id": "e8a10001-0002-4001-8001-000000000002",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SummaryUpdateClassificationFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, UpdateClassification) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| distinct UpdateClassification\n| where isnotempty(UpdateClassification)\n| order by UpdateClassification asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Update Classification"
          },
          {
            "id": "e8a10001-0005-4001-8001-000000000005",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "SummaryOSVersionFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, OSVersion) by AzureADDeviceId\n| distinct OSVersion\n| where isnotempty(OSVersion)\n| order by OSVersion desc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "OS Version"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters-driver-compliance-summary"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _driver = \"{SummaryDriverNameFilter}\";\nlet _classification = dynamic([{SummaryUpdateClassificationFilter}]);\nlet _osVer = dynamic([{SummaryOSVersionFilter}]);\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, OSVersion) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, OSVersion;\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, DeviceName, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification, ClientState, ClientSubstate) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where _driver == \"\" or UpdateDisplayName contains _driver\n| where \"*\" in (_classification) or UpdateClassification in (_classification)\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_osVer) or OSVersion in (_osVer)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or (OSVersion startswith \"Windows 11\" and (DeviceName startswith \"MP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"MS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TS5\"))\n| summarize\n    ReportingDevices = dcount(AzureADDeviceId),\n    Installed = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Installed\"),\n    Installing = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Installing\"),\n    Offering = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Offering\"),\n    OnHold = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"OnHold\"),\n    Canceled = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Canceled\"),\n    Unknown = dcountif(AzureADDeviceId, ClientState == \"Unknown\")\n    by UpdateId, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification\n| extend PercentInstalledReported = round(todouble(Installed) / todouble(ReportingDevices) * 100, 1)\n| project UpdateId, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification, ReportingDevices, Installed, Installing, Offering, OnHold, Canceled, Unknown, PercentInstalledReported\n| order by ReportingDevices desc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Compliance per driver tra device con stato riportato",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "PercentInstalledReported",
              "formatter": 8,
              "formatOptions": {
                "min": 0,
                "max": 100,
                "palette": "redGreen"
              }
            }
          ],
          "filter": true,
          "sortBy": [
            {
              "itemKey": "ReportingDevices",
              "sortOrder": 2
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "grid-driver-compliance-summary"
    },
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "## 🖥️ Stato Installazione per Device + Driver\n\nFiltri locali per device, driver, UpdateClassification, ClientState/ClientSubstate, OS Version e stato/classificazione/subtype dell’ultimo alert correlato. Se più alert condividono il timestamp più recente, viene mostrato prima quello Active con classificazione più grave."
      },
      "name": "text-section-device-detail"
    },
    {
      "type": 9,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "id": "e8a20001-0001-4001-8001-000000000001",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailDeviceNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Nome PC (contains)"
          },
          {
            "id": "e8a20001-0002-4001-8001-000000000002",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailDriverNameFilter",
            "type": 1,
            "value": "",
            "label": "Nome Driver (contains)"
          },
          {
            "id": "e8a20001-0003-4001-8001-000000000003",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailUpdateClassificationFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, UpdateClassification) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| distinct UpdateClassification\n| where isnotempty(UpdateClassification)\n| order by UpdateClassification asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Update Classification"
          },
          {
            "id": "e8a20001-0004-4001-8001-000000000004",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailClientStateFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, ClientState) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| distinct ClientState\n| where isnotempty(ClientState)\n| order by ClientState asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Client State"
          },
          {
            "id": "e8a20001-0005-4001-8001-000000000005",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailClientSubstateFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, ClientSubstate) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| distinct ClientSubstate\n| where isnotempty(ClientSubstate)\n| order by ClientSubstate asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Client Substate"
          },
          {
            "id": "e8a20001-0006-4001-8001-000000000006",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailOSVersionFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, OSVersion) by AzureADDeviceId\n| distinct OSVersion\n| where isnotempty(OSVersion)\n| order by OSVersion desc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "OS Version"
          },
          {
            "id": "e8a20001-0007-4001-8001-000000000007",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailAlertStatusFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "let alertCandidates = UCUpdateAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, AlertType, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype\n| where AlertStatus != \"Deleted\";\nlet latestAlertTimes = alertCandidates\n| summarize AlertTime = max(TimeGenerated) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId;\nalertCandidates\n| join kind=inner latestAlertTimes on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where TimeGenerated == AlertTime\n| extend AlertPriority = case(AlertStatus == \"Active\" and AlertClassification == \"Error\", 3, AlertStatus == \"Active\" and AlertClassification == \"Warning\", 2, AlertStatus == \"Active\", 1, 0)\n| summarize arg_max(AlertPriority, AlertTime, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| distinct AlertStatus\n| where isnotempty(AlertStatus)\n| order by AlertStatus asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Alert Status"
          },
          {
            "id": "e8a20001-0008-4001-8001-000000000008",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailAlertClassificationFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "let alertCandidates = UCUpdateAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, AlertType, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype\n| where AlertStatus != \"Deleted\";\nlet latestAlertTimes = alertCandidates\n| summarize AlertTime = max(TimeGenerated) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId;\nalertCandidates\n| join kind=inner latestAlertTimes on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where TimeGenerated == AlertTime\n| extend AlertPriority = case(AlertStatus == \"Active\" and AlertClassification == \"Error\", 3, AlertStatus == \"Active\" and AlertClassification == \"Warning\", 2, AlertStatus == \"Active\", 1, 0)\n| summarize arg_max(AlertPriority, AlertTime, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| distinct AlertClassification\n| where isnotempty(AlertClassification)\n| order by AlertClassification asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Alert Classification"
          },
          {
            "id": "e8a20001-0009-4001-8001-000000000009",
            "version": "KqlParameterItem/1.0",
            "name": "DetailAlertSubtypeFilter",
            "type": 2,
            "isRequired": true,
            "multiSelect": true,
            "quote": "'",
            "delimiter": ",",
            "query": "let alertCandidates = UCUpdateAlert\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, AlertType, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype\n| where AlertStatus != \"Deleted\";\nlet latestAlertTimes = alertCandidates\n| summarize AlertTime = max(TimeGenerated) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId;\nalertCandidates\n| join kind=inner latestAlertTimes on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where TimeGenerated == AlertTime\n| extend AlertPriority = case(AlertStatus == \"Active\" and AlertClassification == \"Error\", 3, AlertStatus == \"Active\" and AlertClassification == \"Warning\", 2, AlertStatus == \"Active\", 1, 0)\n| summarize arg_max(AlertPriority, AlertTime, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| distinct AlertSubtype\n| where isnotempty(AlertSubtype)\n| order by AlertSubtype asc",
            "timeContext": {
              "durationMs": 0
            },
            "typeSettings": {
              "additionalResourceOptions": [
                "value::all"
              ],
              "selectAllValue": "*",
              "showDefault": false
            },
            "queryType": 0,
            "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
            "value": [
              "value::all"
            ],
            "label": "Alert Subtype"
          }
        ],
        "style": "pills",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces"
      },
      "name": "parameters-driver-device-detail"
    },
    {
      "type": 3,
      "content": {
        "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
        "query": "let _device = \"{DetailDeviceNameFilter}\";\nlet _driver = \"{DetailDriverNameFilter}\";\nlet _classification = dynamic([{DetailUpdateClassificationFilter}]);\nlet _state = dynamic([{DetailClientStateFilter}]);\nlet _substate = dynamic([{DetailClientSubstateFilter}]);\nlet _osVer = dynamic([{DetailOSVersionFilter}]);\nlet _alertStatus = dynamic([{DetailAlertStatusFilter}]);\nlet _alertClassification = dynamic([{DetailAlertClassificationFilter}]);\nlet _alertSubtype = dynamic([{DetailAlertSubtypeFilter}]);\nlet _modernOnly = \"{ModernOnly}\";\nlet clientInfo = UCClient\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, OSVersion, OSBuild, LastWUScanTime) by AzureADDeviceId\n| project AzureADDeviceId, OSVersion, OSBuild, LastWUScanTime;\nlet alertCandidates = materialize(\n    UCUpdateAlert\n    | where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n    | where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n    | where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n    | summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, AlertType, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertSubtype\n    | where AlertStatus != \"Deleted\"\n    | project AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, TimeGenerated, AlertType, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL\n);\nlet latestAlertTimes = alertCandidates\n| summarize AlertTime = max(TimeGenerated) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId;\nlet alertInfo = alertCandidates\n| join kind=inner latestAlertTimes on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where TimeGenerated == AlertTime\n| extend AlertPriority = case(AlertStatus == \"Active\" and AlertClassification == \"Error\", 3, AlertStatus == \"Active\" and AlertClassification == \"Warning\", 2, AlertStatus == \"Active\", 1, 0)\n| summarize arg_max(AlertPriority, AlertTime, AlertType, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| extend URL = iff(isempty(URL) or URL startswith \"http\", URL, strcat(\"https://\", URL))\n| project AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId, AlertTime, AlertType, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL;\nUCClientUpdateStatus\n| where TimeGenerated {TimeRange}\n| where UpdateCategory == \"DriverUpdate\"\n| where isnotempty(UpdateId)\n| extend DeviceName = iff(isempty(DeviceName), AzureADDeviceId, DeviceName)\n| summarize arg_max(TimeGenerated, DeviceName, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification, ClientState, ClientSubstate, OfferReceivedTime, RestartRequiredTime, UpdateInstalledTime) by AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where _device == \"\" or DeviceName contains _device\n| where _driver == \"\" or UpdateDisplayName contains _driver\n| where \"*\" in (_classification) or UpdateClassification in (_classification)\n| where \"*\" in (_state) or ClientState in (_state)\n| where \"*\" in (_substate) or ClientSubstate in (_substate)\n| join kind=leftouter clientInfo on AzureADDeviceId\n| where \"*\" in (_osVer) or OSVersion in (_osVer)\n| where _modernOnly == \"all\" or (OSVersion startswith \"Windows 11\" and (DeviceName startswith \"MP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TP5\" or DeviceName startswith \"MS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"WS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"KS5\" or DeviceName startswith \"TS5\"))\n| join kind=leftouter alertInfo on AzureADDeviceId, UpdateId\n| where \"*\" in (_alertStatus) or AlertStatus in (_alertStatus)\n| where \"*\" in (_alertClassification) or AlertClassification in (_alertClassification)\n| where \"*\" in (_alertSubtype) or AlertSubtype in (_alertSubtype)\n| project DeviceName, OSVersion, OSBuild, UpdateDisplayName, UpdateClassification, ClientState, ClientSubstate, AlertType, AlertSubtype, AlertClassification, AlertStatus, ErrorCode, ErrorSymName, Recommendation, URL, AlertTime, OfferReceivedTime, RestartRequiredTime, UpdateInstalledTime, LastWUScanTime, TimeGenerated\n| order by DeviceName asc, UpdateDisplayName asc",
        "size": 0,
        "title": "Stato Driver per Device",
        "timeContext": {
          "durationMs": 0
        },
        "timeContextFromParameter": "TimeRange",
        "queryType": 0,
        "resourceType": "microsoft.operationalinsights/workspaces",
        "visualization": "table",
        "gridSettings": {
          "formatters": [
            {
              "columnMatch": "ClientState",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Installed",
                    "representation": "success",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Installing",
                    "representation": "2",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Offering",
                    "representation": "warning",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "OnHold",
                    "representation": "4",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Canceled",
                    "representation": "cancelled",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Unknown",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "UpdateClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Drivers",
                    "representation": "1",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Firmware",
                    "representation": "2",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  },
                  {
                    "operator": "Default",
                    "representation": "unknown",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "columnMatch": "AlertClassification",
              "formatter": 18,
              "formatOptions": {
                "thresholdsOptions": "icons",
                "thresholdsGrid": [
                  {
                    "operator": "==",
                    "thresholdValue": "Error",
                    "representation": "3",
                    "text": "{0}{1}"
